{
  "bookId": "hero-214202",
  "id": "bond-26000",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26000001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "夜游？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不，只是普通的……起床喝杯水。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "看来你有不错的警惕心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "什么警惕心……我说了我只是来喝水的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "这个习惯，继续保持。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "即便是夜寐之时，也该保证有足够的戒备之心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "不过，想要成为真正的君主，你还不够格。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "我可以教你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "呃……其实我只是想要起床喝完水顺便回去睡个觉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还有做君主什么的，我从来都没有这种想法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……就算有，也顶多是在梦中。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "跟我来，这些东西，你都需要掌握。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……你从来都不听人讲话的吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26000014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "我只是不听废话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
